{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0,"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[],"authorship_tag":"ABX9TyOSsQ3XghuNBJ9SbQETIVek"},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# Project Structure Overview\n","\n","This document outlines the main sections and workflows of the project \"Interpreting Pain Scales in Knee X‑Rays\". It is intended to give instructors a clear view of the code and analysis pipeline.\n","\n","---\n","\n","## 1. Data Preparation\n","\n","* **Objective**: Construct the master dataset `master_v00_right.csv`.\n","* **Key steps**:\n","\n","  * Merge structural scores (`oai_kxrsemiquant01.csv`), pain surveys (`oai_koos_womac01.csv`), and demographic data (`oai_enrollee01.csv`).\n","  * Remove duplicate columns by priority (semi > none > demo > pain).\n","  * Filter to visit `V00` and side = right.\n","  * Compute `pain_score` (KOOS/WOMAC) and binary pain label.\n","  * Average repeated measurements (subject × date × side).\n","  * Export CSV files under `data/`.\n","\n","## 2. Model Training\n","\n","* **Script**: `src/train.py`\n","* **Approach**:\n","\n","  * Load `master_v00_right.csv` (or `master_v00_both.csv`).\n","  * Define feature sets:\n","\n","    * `struct` only: features starting with `xr...`.\n","    * `full`: `struct` + demographic columns (`sex, ageyears, race, BMI, site, side`).\n","  * Impute missing values by column median.\n","  * Split into train/test (75%/25%, `random_state=42`).\n","  * Train an XGBoost regressor (`hist` tree method, 400 trees, depth 6).\n","  * Evaluate R² on test set.\n","  * Save model to `models/model_struct_right.pkl` or `models/model_full_right.pkl`.\n","  * Record R² values in JSON and auto‑generate a LaTeX table under `reports/tables/`.\n","\n","## 3. SHAP Analysis\n","\n","* **Script**: `src/shap_analysis.py`\n","* **Approach**:\n","\n","  * Load the trained model and input features.\n","  * Sample 1,000 rows for speed.\n","  * Compute TreeSHAP values using `shap.TreeExplainer`.\n","  * Identify top‑20 features by mean(|SHAP|) and save to `outputs/top20.json`.\n","  * Plot the top‑20 beeswarm chart and save to `reports/figures/fig_shap_beeswarm.png`.\n","  * Generate a LaTeX table of top‑15 features (mean |SHAP|) in `reports/tables/tbl_shap_top.tex`.\n","\n","## 4. Sufficient/Necessary Explanations (SANE)\n","\n","* **Scripts**:\n","\n","  * `src/sane_bruteforce.py`  (brute‑force SANE)\n","  * `src/sane_global_plot.py`  (aggregate S/N frequencies)\n","\n","* **Brute‑force SANE**:\n","\n","  * For each of k = 4, 5, 6, 7:\n","\n","    * Enumerate all subsets up to size k.\n","    * Identify minimal sufficient subset $S$: smallest feature set that preserves prediction within ε.\n","    * Identify minimal necessary subset $N$: smallest feature set whose removal changes prediction by > ε.\n","  * Randomly sample `nsamp` instances and save results to `outputs/sane_samples_*.json`.\n","\n","* **Global Summary**:\n","\n","  * Count frequency of each feature appearing in S and N across all samples.\n","  * Plot grouped bar chart (P(S) vs P(N)) in `reports/figures/fig_sane_bar.png`.\n","  * Create LaTeX summary table `reports/tables/sane_full.tex`.\n","\n","## 5. Fairness Evaluation\n","\n","* **Scripts**:\n","\n","  * `src/propensity_score_matching.py`  (1:1 matching)\n","  * `src/residual_analysis.py`         (regression residuals)\n","  * `src/boxplot_pain_vs_KL.py`        (pain vs. KL rating boxplot)\n","\n","* **Steps**:\n","\n","  1. **Propensity score matching**:\n","\n","     * Impute structural features, train logistic regression for treatment flag (Black vs White), match 1:1 without replacement.\n","  2. **Residual analysis**:\n","\n","     * Fit linear regression of `pain_score` on structural features.\n","     * Compute residuals and compare mean residual by race.\n","  3. **Distribution comparison**:\n","\n","     * Generate boxplots of `pain_score` vs. KL grade to visualize group differences.\n","\n","## 6. Appendix\n","\n","* Additional code, notes, or alternate parameter sweeps.\n","\n","---\n","\n","*End of project structure overview.*\n"],"metadata":{"id":"3_U0dYFJWffq"}}]}